file in `docs/weeks/`; this game's Play paste in `docs/PLAY_GROWTH.md`;
`docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md`, `docs/LEARNINGS.md`, and
`docs/YEAR_ROADMAP_SOURCES.md`; facts from other developers only if you
opened the page in this chat and can name the URL. Grade A may change the
batch. Grade B is an example after a hole here is already clear. Grade C
