"Mer endgame" deepens KEY, Gauntlet, Rift, Greater Rift, and Ashen. Craft
Trial stays under MORE → CRAFT. A new zone, class, hunt, God Hand
direction, second sim, IAP, or gacha is allowed when they name it, or when
